  evolutions:
  - stageIndex: 1
    displayName: 
    description: 'Three minutes of screaming cold, then hours of clarity. People have started noticing which hours they spend it on.'
  - stageIndex: 2
    displayName: 
    description: 'The clarity is the product. What people do with it has stopped being predictable, and a few tanks have quietly gone off the billing system.'
  - stageIndex: 3
    displayName: 
    description: 'Tanks off the billing system now outnumber the ones on it. Nobody has reported this, because the reporting was also off the system.'
  - stageIndex: 4
    displayName: 
    description: 'Three minutes of screaming cold, then hours of clarity. It''s in every forward position now, because clarity turned out to be a supply issue like any other.'
  - stageIndex: 5
    displayName: 'The Plunge'
    description: 'Still three minutes of screaming cold. The difference is the clarity on the other side is yours, and you''d have gotten there anyway.'
